{"parse":{"title":"1.001.101","pageid":7421,"text":{"*":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"breadcrumb noexcerpt\"><div class=\"breadcrumb-item\"><a href=\"/wiki/Game_Version\" title=\"Game Version\">Game Version</a></div><div class=\"breadcrumb-item breadcrumb-item-final\">1.001.101</div></div>\n<div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Patch 1.001.101</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:HD2_Construction_Tag.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"HD2 Construction Tag.png\" src=\"/images/HD2_Construction_Tag.png?846071\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1920\" height=\"622\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"622\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-release&#95;date\" data-druid-section-row=\"Info\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-release&#95;date\">Release date</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-release&#95;date druid-data-nonempty\">\n2024-09-18</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-release&#95;time\" data-druid-section-row=\"Info\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-release&#95;time\">Release time</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-release&#95;time druid-data-nonempty\">\n09:00 UTC</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-size\" data-druid-section-row=\"Info\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-size\">Update Size</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-size druid-data-nonempty\">\n54.0 MB</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-versions\" data-druid-section-row=\"Info\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-versions\">Versions</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-versions druid-data-nonempty\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/Game_Version\" title=\"Game Version\">1.001.101</a></div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-blog\" data-druid-section-row=\"Info\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-blog\">Blog Post</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-blog druid-data-nonempty\">\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/553850/view/4679892274002466936\">https://store.steampowered.com/news/app/553850/view/4679892274002466936</a></div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Chronology\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Chronology\">Chronology</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-previous\" data-druid-section-row=\"Chronology\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-previous\">Previous</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-previous druid-data-nonempty\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/1.001.100\" title=\"1.001.100\">1.001.100</a></div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-next\" data-druid-section-row=\"Chronology\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-next\">Next</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-next druid-data-nonempty\">\n<a href=\"/wiki/1.001.102\" title=\"1.001.102\">1.001.102</a></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>1.001.101</b> was a hotfix update released for Helldivers 2. It was mislabeled as 1.001.001.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Overview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Overview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Fixes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Fixes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Known_Issues\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Issues</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Top_Priority\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Top Priority</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Medium_Priority\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Medium Priority</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Overview\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Overview\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fix for <a href=\"/wiki/SH-32_Shield_Generator_Pack\" title=\"SH-32 Shield Generator Pack\">SH-32 Shield Generator Pack</a></li>\n<li>Crash fix</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Fixes\">Fixes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Fixes\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Fixes\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fix for a crash during host migration when a new player joins.</li>\n<li>Helldivers were accidentally granted the <a href=\"/wiki/SH-32_Shield_Generator_Pack\" title=\"SH-32 Shield Generator Pack\">SH-32 Shield Generator Packs</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/General_Brasch\" title=\"General Brasch\">General Brasch</a>\u00b4s personal stash. These are reserved for 10 star generals only. The workers at the distribution center have been sent to re-education camps and regular shields will resume distribution.\n<ul><li>(It previously made the Helldiver immune to melee damage)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Issues\">Known Issues</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Known Issues\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Known Issues\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>These are the highest priority issues that were either introduced by this patch and are being worked on, or are from a previous version and have not yet been fixed. This is not a comprehensive list.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Top_Priority\">Top Priority</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Top Priority\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Top Priority\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Players may not receive Friend Requests sent from another platform</li>\n<li>Large units have no audio cues, allowing them to sneak up on players</li>\n<li>Enemies will try to shoot the generators through walls in the Rescue High-Value Assets mission</li>\n<li>Enemies are sometimes capable of shooting through walls</li>\n<li>Social menu is stuck on \u2018Please Wait Democratically\u2019 for some players</li>\n<li>Dead bodies of Chargers can launch the Helldiver into the air</li>\n<li>Stratagem balls bounce unpredictably off cliffs and some spots</li>\n<li>Players may sometimes be unable to join specific friends, or are returned to ship when joined</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Medium_Priority\">Medium Priority</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Medium Priority\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/1.001.101?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Medium Priority\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Reinforcement may not be available for players who join a game in progress</li>\n<li>Mines may become invisible or may disappear in Multiplayer lobbies</li>\n<li>Pelican-1 may sometimes be launched away if hit with an impaler tentacle</li>\n<li>Supply packs may be incorrectly used if pressing down on a controller while calling in a stratagem</li>\n<li>Friends \"Invite only\" games can still be seen on the Galactic War Map but cannot be joined</li>\n<li>High damage weapons will not detonate hellbombs</li>\n<li>Some enemies that bleed out do not progress Personal Orders and Eradicate missions</li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261028012331\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary\u2010revision\u2010sha1, show\u2010toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.101 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 201/1000000\nRevision size: 2402/4194304 bytes\nPost\u2010expand include size: 5362/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 89/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 2/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post\u2010expand size: 0/10000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/5000\nLua time usage: 0.007/15.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 664411/52428800 bytes\nNumber of processed Cargo queries: 2\nTime spent processing Cargo queries: 0.011 s (avg. 0.006 s)\nNumber of Cargo row insertion attempts: 1\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   78.546      1 Template:Infobox_Game_Version\n100.00%   78.546      1 -total\n 78.29%   61.491      1 Template:Breadcrumb_Auto\n 10.09%    7.925      1 Template:Article_other\n  2.88%    2.265      2 Template:Update\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key helldivers_en:pcache:idhash:7421-0!canonical and timestamp 20261028012331 and revision id 95287. Rendering was triggered because: RefreshLinksJob\n -->\n</div>"}}}